p2k: observe IRQ0 delivery from TCG and PIC EOI paths

Expose narrow audit hooks to the Pinball 2000 machine so its timing panel
can distinguish PIT-derived expected edges from observed IRQ0 delivery:
TCG clkint handler entries and master-PIC EOI writes that clear IRQ0.
Adds intack (do_interrupt_x86_hardirq) and IRET (helper_iret_protected)
observers so the audit panel can split per-segment dwell.

